WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Sora creates a local demonstration identity in the Orifude TUI.

00:03.000 --> 00:06.500
Sora writes, previews, folds, and releases a letter.

00:06.500 --> 00:08.200
A waiting letter from Mori is claimed and explicitly unfolded.

00:08.200 --> 00:10.560
Sora writes the one allowed reply and keeps the exchange.
